  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the flats are occupied.",
    "Condition : 4 - No additional flank windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in the ___eastern_________ wall of the extension hereby approved without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 5 - The use hereby permitted shall not be begun until full particulars and details of a scheme to insulate the premises against the transmission of  air borne  and impact  sound has been submitted to and approved by the local planning authority; these details should have  particular  regard to soundproofing between the ground and first floor  and between the party walls. The development shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given"
